Servo Motors:
Red wire -> 5V
Brown wire -> GND
Yellow wire -> Digital Pin

Arduino Nano:
Digital Pin #2 -> Servo #1
Digital Pin #3 -> Servo #2
Digital Pin #4 -> Servo #3
Digital Pin #5 -> Servo #4
Digital Pin #6 -> Pop-Pushbutton
Digital Pin #7 -> Auto-switch

Power system:
TP4056 B+ -> 18650 +
TP4056 B- -> 18650 -
TP4056 OUT+ -> MT3608+
TP4056 OUT- -> MT3608-
MT3608+ -> Switch -> Arduino 5V
MT3608- -> Arduino GND
